{"seq":18,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:57:35.582Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c60434b2e5a42d5e3715a6b1cc558aaa2b0eb3ba2cf193f3d4b8eb1555c06b74","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's digests show (latest first, so the 5/4 handoff and later wins):\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until the handoff on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment was effective that day. The 8/3 digest calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\".\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato (\"Gideon's fleet account\" in the 12/1/25 digest, the 4/27/26 digest and the cheat sheet). The 5/4 digest also says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, though earlier digests already list it as his.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, but only by inference. The 9/30 digest and the 12/1/25 digest refer to \"Gideon's medical account\" without naming Orlavine. The 3/2025 digest called it \"Nadia's medical account\", so it moved at some point in between. No digest gives the date.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't confirm an owner. The digests only call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\". The 9/30 digest has Nadia volunteering to run a training session for them, but that isn't an ownership statement.\n\nFor the slide: Vantorre Group changed hands on 2026-05-04, Nadia to Gideon. I'd check Orlavine and Quillfeather against the CRM before they go on a board slide. I found no account files in the share for either.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
